# VeritasAI – Project Setup Walkthrough

## What Was Built

A complete Node.js + Express project scaffold for an AI-generated media detection platform, using **vanilla HTML/CSS/JS** on the frontend and **Node.js** on the backend — no frameworks, TypeScript, or bundlers.

## Project Structure

```
Vertias/
├── .env                     # Environment variables
├── .gitignore               # Ignores node_modules, .env, uploads, db
├── package.json             # NPM config (13 dependencies)
├── db/                      # SQLite database directory
├── uploads/                 # Uploaded media files
├── server/
│   ├── index.js             # Express entry point
│   ├── routes/
│   │   ├── analyze.js       # POST /api/analyze (stub)
│   │   ├── upload.js        # POST /api/upload (multer)
│   │   ├── auth.js          # POST /api/auth/register, /login, GET /me
│   │   └── scans.js         # GET /api/scans, /api/scans/:id
│   └── lib/
│       ├── db.js            # SQLite setup (users, scans, token_usage)
│       ├── auth.js          # JWT middleware (requireAuth, optionalAuth)
│       ├── longcat.js       # LLM API wrapper
│       ├── prompts.js       # System/user prompt templates
│       └── frameExtract.js  # Video frame extraction (ffmpeg)
└── public/
    ├── index.html           # Landing page
    ├── scan.html            # Scan page (upload/URL)
    ├── history.html         # Scan history
    ├── login.html           # Login form
    ├── register.html        # Registration form
    ├── css/style.css        # Full design system
    └── js/
        ├── main.js          # Auth, nav, forms, scan logic
        ├── results.js       # Result rendering stub
        └── history.js       # History fetch & filter
```

## Key Backend Features

| Feature | Details |
|---------|---------|
| **Rate Limiting** | 10 req/hr unauthenticated, 50 req/hr authenticated |
| **Database** | SQLite via better-sqlite3, WAL mode, FK constraints |
| **Auth** | bcrypt (12 rounds) + JWT (7-day expiry) |
| **Upload** | multer with 100 MB limit, MIME filtering |
| **SPA Fallback** | Non-API GET routes serve [index.html](file:///c:/xampp/htdocs/Vertias/public/index.html) |

